ascular dementia proposed by the State of California Alzheimer's Disease Diagnostic and Treatment Centers</article-title><source>Neurology</source><year>1992</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>473</fpage><lpage>480</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1549205</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Erkinjuntti</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ostbye</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Steenhuis</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hachinski</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The effect of different diagnostic criteria on the prevalence of dementia</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1997</year><volume>337</volume><fpage>1667</fpage><lpage>1674</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9385127</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wetterling</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kanitz</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Borgis</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The ICD-10 criteria for vascular dementia</article-title><source>Dementia</source><year>1994</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>185</fpage><lpage>188</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8087177</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Erkinjuntti</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowler</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name><name><surname>DeCarli</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Fazekas</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Inzitari</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><